{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42445","headline":"别诸同志 · 锺蒨","name":"别诸同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"随阳来万里，点点度遥空。\n影落长江水，声悲半夜风。\n残秋辞绝漠，无定似惊蓬。\n我有离羣恨，飘飘类此鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"锺蒨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}